# requirements/stellar/cluster-search.ears
capability: Stellar cluster search
owner: stellar
requirements:
  - id: STL-001
    pattern: event
    text: "When target regions are predeclared, the system shall record the reason for each region."
    rationale: "Region choice is a researcher degree of freedom; it must be declared."
    verification: test
    tiers: [T1]
    gates: [STL-G-01]
    status: draft
    traces: []
  - id: STL-002
    pattern: ubiquitous
    text: "Feature-space transformations shall be versioned policies, and raw five-axis Euclidean clustering shall not feed a gate."
    rationale: "Five raw Euclidean axes mix incommensurate units."
    verification: test
    tiers: [T1]
    status: draft
    traces: []
  - id: STL-003
    pattern: ubiquitous
    text: "Quality cuts shall be configuration recorded in the manifest."
    rationale: "Quality cuts change results; they are configuration, not code."
    verification: test
    tiers: [T4]
    status: draft
    traces: []
  - id: STL-004
    pattern: optional
    text: "Where a GPU clustering adapter is used, the system shall exclude its results from gates unless the agreement test passed in the same release."
    rationale: "GPU results are admissible only after agreement with the CPU reference (ADR-007)."
    verification: test
    tiers: [T8]
    gates: [STL-G-08]
    status: draft
    traces: []
  - id: STL-005
    pattern: ubiquitous
    text: "A candidate shall be cross-matched against two benchmarks before it is labelled potentially new."
    rationale: "A candidate that matches a known cluster is not new."
    verification: test
    tiers: []
    gates: [STL-G-06]
    status: draft
    traces: []
  - id: STL-006
    pattern: ubiquitous
    text: "Null-field and injection tests shall run per region with recorded seeds."
    rationale: "False-positive and completeness estimates need reproducible seeds."
    verification: test
    tiers: [T8]
    status: draft
    traces: []
  - id: STL-007
    pattern: ubiquitous
    text: "Rejected and inconclusive candidates shall be retained with failure reasons."
    rationale: "Negative results are evidence."
    verification: test
    tiers: []
    gates: [STL-G-07]
    status: draft
    traces: []
